<section class="ls-section" style="padding-top:80px;" data-reveal>
  <div class="ls-container" style="max-width:920px;">
    <div class="ls-eyebrow">Questions, briefly answered</div>
    <h2 class="ls-section-title" style="margin-top:14px;margin-bottom:40px;font-size:clamp(32px,4.2vw,48px);letter-spacing:-1.1px;">
      A few things to know <em>before you write</em>.
    </h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        <details class="faq-item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <summary>
            {{ block.settings.question }}
            <span style="color:var(--ls-ink-60);">{%- render 'icon-chevron-down', size: 16 -%}</span>
          </summary>
          <p>{{ block.settings.answer }}</p>
        </details>
      {%- else -%}
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How long does it take to make a custom veil? <span style="color:var(--ls-ink-60);">{%- render 'icon-chevron-down', size: 16 -%}</span></summary>
          <p>All designs are made-to-order. Once approved your piece is dispatched within 72 hours of completion — most brides receive their veils within four to six weeks of enquiring.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Do you ship internationally? <span style="color:var(--ls-ink-60);">{%- render 'icon-chevron-down', size: 16 -%}</span></summary>
          <p>We do. Express worldwide shipping is complimentary on orders over $300 AUD. Buyers may be responsible for customs or import taxes.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can I customise a veil from the collection? <span style="color:var(--ls-ink-60);">{%- render 'icon-chevron-down', size: 16 -%}</span></summary>
          <p>Absolutely — every veil can be made in any length, edge, or with custom embroidery. Email a photo of your gown to info@lovestoryatelier.com to begin.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can I visit the Brisbane studio? <span style="color:var(--ls-ink-60);">{%- render 'icon-chevron-down', size: 16 -%}</span></summary>
          <p>Studio visits are by appointment only. We'll share the address when we confirm your visit.</p>
        </details>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ",
  "tag": "div",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "question",
      "name": "FAQ item",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text",     "id": "question", "label": "Question" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "answer",   "label": "Answer" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "FAQ" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
